There's a mod for visibility on the creep, but why?

2755
03:08:33,190 --> 03:08:37,370
The fact that people had to make a mod means that the game is not designed well in that regard.

2756
03:08:38,190 --> 03:08:39,370
It's obviously a pro...

2757
03:08:39,370 --> 03:08:41,350
What about people that are actually colorblind?

2758
03:08:42,170 --> 03:08:44,650
Good luck to those seeing the difference there.

2759
03:08:46,490 --> 03:08:46,810
You know?

2760
03:08:47,090 --> 03:08:48,030
Like, what the hell, man?

2761
03:08:49,990 --> 03:08:52,630
What about people that actually have reduced the vision?

2762
03:08:53,110 --> 03:08:55,350
It's pretty much impossible to see that, if you're one of those people.

2763
03:08:58,420 --> 03:08:59,400
It's only bad in the womb.

2764
03:08:59,540 --> 03:09:02,040
Yeah, but if you can't get through the womb, then you can't complete the game.

2765
03:09:03,480 --> 03:09:03,700
Right?

2766
03:09:06,960 --> 03:09:08,980
I'm colorblind, I have more problems with red poop.

2767
03:09:08,980 --> 03:09:12,880
Oh, I guess you just run in and destroy all the poop prematurely, just to check.

2768
03:09:13,640 --> 03:09:14,060
Or make sure.

2769
03:09:15,620 --> 03:09:16,800
Is the game telling you to play Azazel?

2770
03:09:17,060 --> 03:09:18,820
Oh, the draw of Azazel.

2771
03:09:19,940 --> 03:09:20,780
I shall resist.

2772
03:09:21,180 --> 03:09:25,380
But, you know what, maybe we should make it a thing to always start with Azazel.

2773
03:09:25,500 --> 03:09:27,940
Just to, you know, rev up the engine, so to speak.

2774
03:09:31,090 --> 03:09:33,210
Every time I play Azazel, I actually have such a blast.

2775
03:09:34,210 --> 03:09:35,030
I gotta admit that.

2776
03:09:35,210 --> 03:09:37,290
Like, it is just such a blast to play with Azazel.

2777
03:09:38,510 --> 03:09:39,090
It's insane.

2778
03:09:39,850 --> 03:09:40,810
He's so much fun.

2779
03:09:40,890 --> 03:09:42,990
I love the flying, I love the laser.

2780
03:09:44,470 --> 03:09:45,110
So good.

2781
03:09:47,990 --> 03:09:52,830
But there are some characters that you can only unlock if you do something very specific.

2782
03:09:53,690 --> 03:09:55,550
There is one thing that I need to do with Lazarus.

2783
03:09:56,890 --> 03:10:00,670
I think it's to complete it without respawning once, right?

2784
03:10:01,150 --> 03:10:03,310
Stuff like that, that stuff I want to do, of course.

2785
03:10:04,710 --> 03:10:04,730
Yeah.

2786
03:10:05,850 --> 03:10:06,770
Anyway, I gotta go now.

2787
03:10:07,270 --> 03:10:08,070
Thank you so much for watching.

2788
03:10:08,070 --> 03:10:11,250
I'm so proud of myself for actually dying on time.

2789
03:10:12,850 --> 03:10:15,290
So it's exactly three hours, or a little over three hours, but yeah.

2790
03:10:16,050 --> 03:10:16,830
Thanks for watching.

2791
03:10:17,170 --> 03:10:17,990
This was a banger.

2792
03:10:18,430 --> 03:10:19,870
Even though we didn't get a win, it's okay.

2793
03:10:20,770 --> 03:10:21,570
Lots of stuff learned.

2794
03:10:22,330 --> 03:10:23,070
And I'm getting better.

2795
03:10:23,510 --> 03:10:24,150
I'll see you next time.

2796
03:10:24,230 --> 03:10:24,410
Bye-bye.

